# ITSM egress allowlist: one anchored, case-insensitive regex per line, matched against the
# CONNECT host (port 443 only). Every addition needs a security review (CP6b).
# Jira Cloud tenants: exactly one label under atlassian.net (not atlassian.net itself).
^[a-z0-9]([a-z0-9-]{0,61}[a-z0-9])?\.atlassian\.net$
# Lark Open Platform (international and China).
^open\.larksuite\.com$
^open\.feishu\.cn$
# Company IdPs for SSO (CP5c), add per company after review, e.g.:
# ^login\.microsoftonline\.com$
# ^accounts\.google\.com$
# ^oauth2\.googleapis\.com$
# ^www\.googleapis\.com$
